    "chunk_text": "ne; ic bletsige eow & do \u00e6lce untrumnyssae eow fram, & geice eower dagas, & & ic asende hyrnetta, \u00fee aflyme\u00fe Efeum & Chananeum twelf mon\u00f0um, \u00e6r \u00f0u in fare. Ic sette \u00feine gem\u00e6ro fram \u00feare Readan S\u00e6, & fram \u00feam westene o\u00fe flod. Nafa \u00feu nane sibbe wi\u00f0 heora godas, \u00f0i l\u00e6s \u00f0e hi \u00fee beswicon. HE cw\u00e6\u00fe to Moyse: Astih to Drihtne, \u00feu & Aaron, Nadab & Abiu & hundseofontig ealde of Israhela Moyses ana astih\u00f0 to Drihtne. Moyses com eft, & rehte \u00feam folce ealle Drihtnes word, & hi cw\u00e6don anre stemne: We do\u00fe ealle Moyses wrat ealle Drihtnes sp\u00e6ca, & aras on morgen & getimbrode an weofod \u00e6t \u00feam munte Moyses sende cnihtas, \u00f0\u00e6t offrodan twelf cealfas. & Moyses nam healf \u00f0\u00e6t blod & dyde on geryde orcas & geat \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00feer uppan \u00fe\u00e6t weofod; & r\u00e6dde & he nam \u00fe\u00e6t blod & sprengde \u00fe\u00e6t folc, & cw\u00e6\u00f0: \u00feis is \u00f0\u00e6re treow\u00f0e blod, \u00fee Drihten eow behet be Moyses & Aaron, Nadab & Abiu & hundseofontig Israhela folces ealdro astygon. & hi gesawon Israhela God, & under his foton w\u00e6s swylce \u00fe\u00e6s stanes \u00f0e man saphiros on Leden Israhela bearn gesawon Drihten, & \u00e6ton & druncon. SY\u00d0\u00d0AN \u00feu gehalgast heora handa, \u00feu offrast an cealf; Aaron & his suna setta\u00fe heora handa uppan & \u00feu cwel",
